description: Liquid and Online Store 2.0 conventions for theme files
globs: layout/**/*,sections/**/*,snippets/**/*,templates/**/*,config/**/*,locales/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Liquid / theme files

- Prefer `{% render 'snippet' %}` over `{% include %}`.
- Keep section schemas valid JSON inside `{% schema %}…{% endschema %}`.
- Reuse Dawn snippets (`card-product`, etc.) before duplicating markup.
- For new JS-heavy UI, wire a Vite web component from `frontend/` instead of large inline scripts.
- Load Vite assets only through the existing `vite-tag` renders in `layout/theme.liquid`.
- Add merchant-facing strings to `locales/` (at least `en.default.json` / schema locales when editing settings labels).
- Run Theme Check mentally: no undefined objects, unused variables, or deprecated filters in new code.
